          <!-- CMM & Metrology -->
          <div class="rounded-xl p-5 transition-all duration-300" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 12%, transparent);">
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold mb-1" style="color: var(--theme-text);">CMM, OGP & Surface Profilometry</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 55%, transparent);">
              In-house metrology lab equipped with ZEISS CONTURA G2 CMM (1.9 μm accuracy), OGP SmartScope optical comparators, and Mitutoyo SJ-410 surface roughness testers. All instruments calibrated per ISO 17025 traceable standards.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- PMI Validation -->
          <div class="rounded-xl p-5 transition-all duration-300" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 12%, transparent);">
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold mb-1" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Positive Material Identification (PMI)</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 55%, transparent);">
              On-site SPECTROMAXx Optical Emission Spectrometry (OES) confirms elemental composition within 30 seconds per ASTM E415, ensuring every incoming batch matches the specified grade chemistry before production release.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- NDT -->
          <div class="rounded-xl p-5 transition-all duration-300" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 12%, transparent);">
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold mb-1" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Non-Destructive Testing (NDT)</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 55%, transparent);">
              Fluorescent Penetrant Inspection (FPI) for surface flaw detection and ultrasonic (UT) for subsurface volumetric examination. Nadcap-accredited processes available for critical aerospace and medical applications.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
